                        "entry_id": "ee95dc66-cb56-3225-8754-a67b7b313675",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Very large; especially, very large and also expansive, fat, impressive, muscular, intimidating, or important."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang",
                            "vulgar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "423928a0-d4fe-45a9-bfc7-f5dca69d25e1",
                                "sense_id": "cfbc3ec3-6020-3e36-8972-79c8994961d7",
                                "text": "A: That's one big-ass sandwich you've got there. Where'd you get that thing? B: From the deli on Main Street."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7cbc4ea4-d331-4335-9311-a535450fbb77",
                                "sense_id": "cfbc3ec3-6020-3e36-8972-79c8994961d7",
                                "text": "It had two big sliding doors and the whole front was a mirror, one big ass mirror jim."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ebad557-843c-486c-8ee3-b2736410f6bb",
                                "sense_id": "cfbc3ec3-6020-3e36-8972-79c8994961d7",
                                "text": "What is all this talk about some bigass executive coming in to buy this town?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f707673-b786-4604-ae16-abc9ac6aedb6",
                                "sense_id": "cfbc3ec3-6020-3e36-8972-79c8994961d7",
                                "text": "With flowers and candles and a bigass cake, the fellowship hall sufficed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4f587ac-8fa9-4932-9416-c6acdf068914",
                                "sense_id": "cfbc3ec3-6020-3e36-8972-79c8994961d7",
                                "text": "They steered around the courtyard, where they could see the bastards in black sweatshirts and the bigass altered mobsters with big-ass guns holding off the OCU and trying to advance on the Sibyls."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
